speechtext:
It is not possible to separate (a) and (b) therefore 8,699 represents C.F.B. Halifax which includes all units located in the Halifax area, H.M.C.S. Stadacona, H.M.C. Dockyard, Maritime Command Headquarters and ships at sea, (c) 2,334; (d) 1,898;
(e)	803; (f) this is a townsite for some of the married service personnel in Maritime Command; (g) this was a wartime designation and no longer exists; (h) 1,302; (i) 3,758;
(j)	1,130; (k) 274.
